<!--
  The "PDA টু সাপোর্ট" Settings tile of the owner's manual (screenshot 63): a round badge that runs pink-red at the top to
  blue at the bottom, a white globe at the left and a white monitor at the right with an arrow between them (the phone's
  data file going to support). Drawn here, in feature-home, because core-ui belongs to another lane.
-->
